bind Effect Opportunity Identify: Identifier Opportunity
bind Due Diligence Perform: Identifier Opportunity, Degree Hazard
bind Funding Secure: Identifier Investor, Amount Investment
bind Effect Measure: Metric Effect
bind Returns Distribute: ROI Expected, Identifier Investor
bind Response Collect: Response Stakeholder
bind Investment Exit: Strategy Exit
bind Efficiency Assess: Rating Efficiency
Identifier Opportunity: integer between 1 and 99999
ROI Expected: float between 0 and 100
Degree Hazard: Low, Medium, High
Identifier Investor: integer between 1 and 9999
Investment Type: Equity, Debt, Grant
Amount Investment: float between 1000 and 10000000
Metric Effect: Social, Environmental, Economic
Response Stakeholder: Positive, Neutral, Negative
Strategy Exit: Acquisition, Public Offering, Liquidation
Rating Efficiency: integer between 1 and 10
